  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbetterdogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c93b172f-e281-4d3c-823a-400a3f2c4287.png\" width=\"781\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqzvDFF.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"255\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本页还提供独立版本（请向下滑动）</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用前必读<br>此资源包适用于从 1.8.9 到 1.21.4 及以下的 Minecraft 版本。<br></strong>运行此资源包需要&nbsp;<strong>Optifine</strong>（Forge版）或 <strong>EMF + ETF</strong>（Forge/Fabric版）或 <strong>CEM + Puzzle</strong>（Fabric版）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示：对于 EMF + ETF 和 CEM + Puzzle，请参阅下方折叠区列出的所需模组。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>注1：在 Fabric 环境下使用此资源包可能会导致某些狗模型出现轻微的小问题。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><br>注2：部分基础功能可能存在轻微异常，但可通过以下方法解决：<br>驯服狼或为已驯服的狼佩戴支持的名字牌后，按 <strong>F3 + T</strong> 即可使狗品种在游戏内显示。</em>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">___</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>以下是使 Better Dog 资源包与 Fabric/Sodium 兼容所需的模组。所有模组均需放入 minecraft 的 mods 文件夹中。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重要<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">：</span></strong>请确保所有模组均与您使用的 Fabric 版本相匹配。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric（CEM + Puzzle (Fabric) 必需）</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>所需模组（EMF + ETF (Forge/Fabric)）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 1.20.1 - 1.19.3 版本）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Entity Model Features</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API<br><br></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所需模组</strong> <strong>（CEM + Puzzle (Fabric)）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示！</strong> Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本的所需模组需要以下配置设置：&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fF8e45wQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/F8e45wQ</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-entity-models-cem/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Custom Entity Models (CEM)</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cloth Config API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/completeconfig/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CompleteConfig</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Puzzle</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><strong>可选（非必需，但强烈建议安装以提升帧率）：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Phosphor</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;（若遇到问题，请阅读下方的说明）&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kOcFo9u.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"1301\"><br>各品种游戏内截图：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YpK30pq.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yfiBnIR.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"648\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>指南 - 添加自定义名字牌：<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>在本简短指南中，我们将为金毛寻回犬添加自定义名字牌：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1) 进入</strong> Minecraft 资源包文件夹。（%appdata% > .minecraft > resourcepacks）<br><br><strong>2) 打开</strong> 您正在使用的 Better Dogs 资源包版本。<br><br><strong>3) 找到</strong> assets/minecraft/Optifine/mob/wolf 目录。<br><br><strong>4) 使用</strong> Notepad++ 或类似的文本编辑工具打开 <em>wolf_tame.properties</em> 文件。<br><br><strong>5) 按</strong> Ctrl + F 并输入您要添加自定义名字的品种名称（本例中使用 <strong><em>金毛寻回犬</em></strong>）<br><br><strong>6) 文件将跳转至以下行：</strong><br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1<br><br></em><strong>7) 当前支持的名字牌如下所示：</strong><br><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><br><strong>8) 我们添加的自定义名字是：Mike wazowski。使用 \"&nbsp;|&nbsp;\" 符号将其与其他名字分隔开：<br><br></strong><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden|Mike wazowski).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1</em><br><strong>9) 覆盖当前的 <em>wolf_tame.properties</em> 文件。现在将支持自定义名字 <em>Mike wazowski</em>。<br>（如果在更改文件时已在游戏中，请同时按 F3 + T 以刷新已激活的资源包）。<br><br><strong>注意：<br>- </strong>本指南适用于所有品种，不仅限于金毛寻回犬。<br>- 除非其他用户也按照此流程添加相同的名字，否则他们在使用自定义名字牌时将无法看到与您相同的品种。<br><br></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">独立版本<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dGHLWnb.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>这些独立版本对帧率的影响小得多<br>（点击下载按钮进行下载）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-wolves/download/3694826/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dX1qDDo.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3511701\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZqR1DL.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3514180\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BL2vsG7.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3528488\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJ0IpsX.png\" alt=\"巴哥犬\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3550731\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DfJy58p.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3738097\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9jI6XTt.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3916688\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83jqNGr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3516155\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cO3jR0v.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3648293\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDzUPmk.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ayukpXn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/download/3550731/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpM1xYP.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>（点击下载按钮进行下载）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-cats-curseforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xe1adNG.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-farm-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aHEmv8l.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3536286\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7KHrHw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pet-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I9AzCyY.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jPEH6of.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JWbz8eY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong>（仅限 Optifine）<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NDszZji.gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3ajCdNW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOcnVCF.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DsCy47K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong></p>\n<p>分步指南：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fVmO4MHx\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>已知不兼容模组列表：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Xaero's minimap：</strong>会导致狗/狼的头部悬浮。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revamped wolf：</strong>会导致模型显示为线条状。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：暂无可用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doggy talents：</strong>会导致模型显示为线条状。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>鸣谢</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffrancielly%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Francy_Chan</a> 为本资源包的 <strong><em>Better dogs V1.2 (With collars)</em></strong> 版本制作了项圈，并协助解决了名字牌相关的问题。</li>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/egoist1372/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EGOIST1372</a> 协助解决此资源包与 Sodium-Fabric 的兼容性问题。</li>\n<li>本页面使用的自定义字体由 codeman38 制作。</li>\n<li>本资源包特殊版本中使用的音效由 Hot Ideas Inc. 和 Zapsplat 制作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未经本人许可，请勿在任何地方上传此资源包。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>在 YouTube 视频中使用本资源包时，请在描述中添加本资源包的链接。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我以此作为业余爱好，但如果您愿意捐赠，我将不胜感激！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrblueyetimc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1192828/description_cd73d6ea-5748-4aa7-9037-23e12d5be3c4.webp\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>当前及往期 Patreon 支持者名单</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">非常感谢所有这些人的支持！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Heyhay13 - Chicken tier（鸡级）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Nqobie - Chicken tier（鸡级）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Rinzler - Chicken tier（鸡级）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><strong>以及另外八位慷慨的匿名赞助者</strong></strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iFbDq72.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/WszQzsB\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MdEY9Xj\" alt=\"\"></p>",
